ke the Certification Exam from the Exam Proctor next to him\nAim for a 75%+ pass chance"},{"label":"Tip","text":"The game autosaves before showing the result. Advanced classes unlocked on one route open on every route."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"earn-temple-blessings","position":2,"content":{"name":"Earn Temple Blessings","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Do Temple Service at Temple Row (up to 2 units, costs Motivation)\nServe on a god's holy day to fill the gauge faster (see the Calendar)\nEquip up to 4 Blessings"},{"label":"Tip","text":"Fortuna's Blessing rewinds turns: free on Normal, 5 Divine Sand on Hard."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"carry-progress-between-routes","position":3,"content":{"name":"Carry progress between routes","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Finish a route before starting the next\nYour map, finished subquests, Blessings, supports and Boons carry forward\nReplaying Chapter 12 updates the party that route takes into Part II"},{"label":"Tip","text":"Finished general subquests auto-complete on later routes and pay their rewards again."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"find-dagsions-services","position":4,"content":{"name":"Find Dagsion's services","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Hightown: classes and Smyrnos's Temple\nMidtown: Headhunter and fortune-telling\nLowtown: Tavern, Stable, trading\nTemple Row: Temple Service"},{"label":"Tip","text":"The Theater and Thermae raise Support; Inns serve meals and support conversations."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"how-does-long-join","position":0,"content":{"name":"How does Long join?","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Long is listed as playable on the wiki, in the Bridal Party of the Pale Raven. Nobody has documented how to get them yet.","stat":"Open","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Open"}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"how-does-anna-join","position":1,"content":{"name":"How does Anna join?","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Anna runs the \"Golden Secret\" paralogue and is listed as playable, but the joining condition is unknown.","stat":"Open","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Open"}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"how-do-you-unlock-the-elephant-rider","position":2,"content":{"name":"How do you unlock the Elephant Rider?","spoiler":true,"source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"A new mount type that appears in Part III. Conditions not documented.","stat":"Open","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Open"}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"who-uses-song-of-beasts","position":3,"content":{"name":"Who uses Song of Beasts?","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"The wiki says it summons Demonic Beasts. Which unit has it is unconfirmed.","stat":"Open","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Open"}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"what-is-bertrands-blaze-art-called","position":4,"content":{"name":"What is Bertrand's Blaze Art called?","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"It cuts physical damage for a turn, seen when fighting him. The name hasn't been recorded.","stat":"Theory","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Theory"}}},{"block":"mysteries","slug":"do-quest-offers-depend-on-route-order","position":5,"content":{"name":"Do quest offers depend on route order?","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Which subquests appear seems partly random, and may depend on the order you play the routes in.","stat":"Theory","sections":[],"categories":{"Status":"Theory"}}}]$seed$::jsonb) loop
    cid := null;
    values ('fortunes-weave', e->>'block', e->>'slug', (e->>'position')::int)
    on conflict (game_id, block_key, slug) do nothing returning id into cid;
    continue when cid is null;  -- already there: leave the community's edits alone
  end loop;
end $$;

-- ocarina-of-time
on conflict (game_id, page_key) do update set title = excluded.title, short = excluded.short, icon = excluded.icon,
  tint = excluded.tint, blurb = excluded.blurb, position = excluded.position;

on conflict (game_id, block_key) do update set title = excluded.title, position = excluded.position,
  page_key = excluded.page_key, type = excluded.type, look = excluded.look, icon = excluded.icon, intro = excluded.intro,
  filters = excluded.filters, by_route = excluded.by_route, stat_name = excluded.stat_name, stats = excluded.stats;

-- Old blocks the Pages replaced
delete from public.game_blocks where page_key is null;
